  "body": "### Describe the bug\n\nreleases widget accepts identifier as pihole/pihole , but not a tag , like pihole/pihole:latest\nThis leaves it to to the weak \"version filter\" feature.\nif one is to enable \"version filter\"  one needs to select numbering format #.# or #.#.# etc, the problem is that many sources vary between two or three digits, like 2.9.5 then 3.0  \n\n<img width=\"782\" height=\"469\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5423823d-227a-4007-a180-df9e816dfe86\" />\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nJust try to add meaningful notification about stable pihole releases.\n\n### Impact\n\nthis widget is basically unusable or  sable for a few apps/sources\n\n### Additional information\n\nadding tag option would easily solve it in a nice way.\nThe filters would also be better if there was an option to select if the given words/regex should include or exclude the result, and omit the whole set of \"#.#.#.#\" options. \n\n\n\n### Version\n\n1.49.0\n\n### Installation method\n\nDocker Compose\n\n### Browser\n\nFirefox",
